experiments/k692/k692_results.json:35:  "conclusion": "Historical paper_trading entries match SAME-DAY returns (lookahead). These were created by initial backtest seeding, not by daily_update.py. The daily_update.py production code is CORRECT (next-day convention). Impact: historical performance metrics (Sharpe/MDD) are overstated.",
