experiments/k1116b/audit_report.md:63:K1116 has **latent lookahead** in NFCI, ANFCI, STLFSI4 (3 of 5 alt-data series). The shift(1) week lag gives only 2-4 trading days of margin, but NFCI requires 5 calendar days and STLFSI requires 6. Hence the weekly regressor for week W-1 is **partially (Wed-Thu-Fri of W) still forward-looking** at the time prediction is needed.
